<title>TUNISIA: Arab Tunisian Bank distributes dividends.</title>
<headline>Arab Tunisian Bank distributes dividends.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arab Tunisian Bank on Monday said it started distributing a 0.65 dinar dividend per share of a nominal price of five dinars on its profits for 1996.</p>
<p>The bank last month reported a 7.37 million dinars net profit in 1996, up from 6.46 million dinars in 1995.</p>
<p>ATB has a capital of 35 million dinars and its balance sheet showed reserves of 38.137 million dinars as the end of 1996.</p>
<p>Its share was last priced 33 dinars on the Tunis stock exchange.</p>
</text>
